  "cards": [
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s14-t03-drill-05-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第5题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s14-t03-drill-05",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（26国考）甲和乙两个长方体零件的体积比为3：2，且甲和乙均有2个面为边长n厘米的正方形。将甲和乙粘接为一个长方体之后，表面积比原来2个零件的表面积之和减少了20%。问乙最短棱的长度是最长棱的：",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "2/3"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "3/4"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "3/5"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "4/5"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "C",
        "sourceAnswer": "C"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          150
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          144
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s14-t03-drill-05-p150.webp",
            "alt": "几何问题（一） · 实战精刷5 · 讲义第144页",
            "pdfPage": 150
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s14-t03-drill-05-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s14-t03-drill-05",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：C"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们把两个边长n的正方形面粘起来，消失的是2n²的表面积。它占原总表面积的20%，所以两个零件原表面积合计10n²。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "甲、乙的正方形截面相同，体积比3：2就是长度比3：2。设长度分别3x、2x，原总表面积为4n²+4n（3x+2x）=10n²，得到x=0.3n。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "4n^2+20nx=\\frac{2n^2}{20\\%}=10n^2\\Rightarrow\\frac{2x}{n}=\\frac35"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "乙三条棱为n、n、0.6n，所以最短与最长之比为3/5，我们选C。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          150
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          144
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s14-t03-drill-05-p150.webp",
            "alt": "几何问题（一） · 实战精刷5 · 讲义第144页",
            "pdfPage": 150
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s14-t03-drill-05-explanation-02",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析 · 2",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s14-t03-drill-05",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "粘接表面积减少两个接触面；同截面体积比等于长度比。"
        }
      ],
