    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s14-t03-drill-06-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第6题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s14-t03-drill-06",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（26广东事考）一艘货轮在大海上行驶，到达A点时测得灯塔C位于南偏东30°方向，往南继续直线行驶8km到B点，此时测得灯塔C位于南偏东60°方向，那么B点时货轮与灯塔C的距离为（）。",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "8km"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "16km"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "4√3km"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "8√3km"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "A",
        "sourceAnswer": "A"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          150
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          144
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s14-t03-drill-06-p150.webp",
            "alt": "几何问题（一） · 实战精刷6 · 讲义第144页",
            "pdfPage": 150
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s14-t03-drill-06-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s14-t03-drill-06",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：A"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先画方位：A到B正南8千米，AC是南偏东30°，BC是南偏东60°。在△ABC中，A角30°；B角要用BA向北的方向与BC夹角，因此为120°。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "剩下C角也为30°，A角与C角相等，对边BC与AB就相等，BC=8千米。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "\\angle A=30^\\circ,\\quad\\angle B=120^\\circ,\\quad\\angle C=30^\\circ\\Rightarrow BC=AB=8"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "所以我们选A。不能把B处的60°直接当作三角形内角。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
