    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s14-t03-drill-07-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第7题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s14-t03-drill-07",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（24山东）某巡逻艇在海域A点发现正南方30千米处的B点有一艘可疑船只正匀速向正西方行驶，巡逻艇以比该可疑船只快1/3的速度沿某一方向直线追击，两船恰好在C点相遇。问B、C两点之间的距离约为多少千米？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "26"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "28"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "30"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "34"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "D",
        "sourceAnswer": "D"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          151
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          145
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s14-t03-drill-07-p151.webp",
            "alt": "几何问题（一） · 实战精刷7 · 讲义第145页",
            "pdfPage": 151
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s14-t03-drill-07-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s14-t03-drill-07",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：D"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先把速度关系转成同一时间的路程关系。巡逻艇比可疑船快1/3，所以两船速度比4：3，追击到相遇时AC：BC也为4：3。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "AB为正南方向30千米，BC向正西，构成直角。设BC=3x、AC=4x，则（4x）²−（3x）²=30²，解得BC=90/√7。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "BC=\\frac{90}{\\sqrt7}\\approx34.0\\text{千米}"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "约34.0千米，我们选D。“快1/3”是原速的4/3，不是3倍。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
