    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s14-t03-drill-08-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第8题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s14-t03-drill-08",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（23江苏）如图所示，纸片ABC的形状为直角三角形，AB=10厘米,BC=8厘米。若将纸片沿AD折叠，直角边AC恰好与斜边AB重叠，则△ABD的面积为（）。",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "15平方厘米"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "16平方厘米"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "18平方厘米"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "21平方厘米"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "A",
        "sourceAnswer": "A",
        "stemBlocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "（23江苏）如图所示，纸片ABC的形状为直角三角形，AB=10厘米,BC=8厘米。若将纸片沿AD折叠，直角边AC恰好与斜边AB重叠，则△ABD的面积为（）。"
          },
          {
            "type": "image",
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s14-t03-drill-08-figure-01.webp",
            "alt": "几何问题（一）原题示意图，讲义第145页",
            "caption": "讲义原图 · 点击放大"
          }
        ]
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          151
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          145
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s14-t03-drill-08-p151.webp",
            "alt": "几何问题（一） · 实战精刷8 · 讲义第145页",
