        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s14-t03-drill-08-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s14-t03-drill-08",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：A"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先用勾股定理：AC=√（10²−8²）=6。沿AD折叠使AC与AB重合，说明AD平分∠CAB。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "由角平分线定理，BD：DC=AB：AC=10：6=5：3；BC共8厘米，因此BD=5厘米。△ABD以BD为底，到BC的高仍是AC=6。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "AC=6,\\quad\\frac{BD}{DC}=\\frac{AB}{AC}=\\frac53,\\quad S_{ABD}=\\frac12\\times5\\times6=15"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "面积为5×6÷2=15平方厘米，我们选A。折叠并不是把底边BC平分。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        }
      ],
